{"ref":"BDB, קֶ֫צֶב","hw":"קֶ֫צֶב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קֶ֫צֶב</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.25\">1 K 6:25</a></sup> <strong>1. cut, shape; 2. extremity</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> abs., <em>shape</em> of cherubim <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:25\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.25\">1 K 6:25</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדָּה</span>), of bases <a data-ref=\"I Kings 7:37\" href=\"/I_Kings.7.37\">7:37</a> (+ id.).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>extremity</em>, pl. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קִצְבֵי הָרִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Jonah 2:7\" href=\"/Jonah.2.7\">Jon 2:7</a> <em>the extremities</em> (bottoms) <em>of</em> (the) <em>mountains</em> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">קצבי הרים</span> <a data-ref=\"Ben Sira 16:19\" href=\"/Ben_Sira.16.19\">Ecclus 16:19</a>).","next":"BDB, קָצָה","prev":"BDB, קָצַב"}